    11	
    12	- **Guard 8 fails at CP3.** Observe §1 requires four complete outlines and zero stubs at 2500 ms. `harness-t242.js:41` checks only outline completion. The filed schedule starts stub 1 at 2400 ms with a 400 ms duration, so its progress is `(2500−2400)/400 = 0.25` at CP3. The same issue occurs at CP5, where Observe requires stub 1 only at 4500 ms and stub 2 is already at `(4500−4400)/400 = 0.25`. The cure is to reconcile the schedule with those states and file the raw stub values at both fixed anchors.
