    14	- **A6 records a proxy measurement and a fit defect.** `fit-table.md` names PIL and DejaVu Sans Bold as its instrument and stand-in. Its own axis-top row places the ink 9 px beyond the left edge at stage width, so the empty HIT list overstates the measured fit. The cure is to remeasure after repositioning or carry the proxy overflow explicitly in the fit disposition.
