../../../../study/style-library/techniques-diagrams.md-140-### T81 — Seed cards with a status taxonomy (P4 T08) ◆ — OWED #38
../../../../study/style-library/techniques-diagrams.md-141-- Tier: **RECREATED**
../../../../study/style-library/techniques-diagrams.md-142-- Mechanics: at the moment a future claim is made, a card appears in a fixed design — a status header from a six-state taxonomy (ALREADY IN USE · ALREADY BEING BUILT · ALREADY IN THE LAB · ALREADY MEASURED · …) — every not-yet-universal claim carries its present evidence as a designed card.
