../../../../study/style-library/techniques-diagrams.md-286-- Tier: **RECREATED**
../../../../study/style-library/techniques-diagrams.md-287-- Mechanics: each satellite arrives the same way: a thin white line (1–2 px) extends from the hub toward the satellite's position over the burst (≈0.16–0.48 s), and the satellite dot (radius ≈21 px) materialises at the line's end as the draw completes; no arrowheads — the line is a relationship, not a flow. **Limit carried at registration: easing is UNMEASURED (see T167).**
